<details class="panel technology-tree"><summary>Arbre technologique <span>{{ cards.technologies|length }} recherches</span></summary><p>Les niveaux sont communs à vos colonies de cet univers. Le laboratoire et la file restent propres à la colonie sélectionnée.</p><div class="technology-tiers">{% for depth,nodes in technology_tree %}<div class="technology-tier"><h2>Palier {{ depth+1 }}</h2>{% for node in nodes %}<article id="tech-{{ node.definition.slug }}" class="tech-node {{ node.available?'available':'' }}"><div class="tech-prerequisites">{% for requirement in node.prerequisites %}<a class="{{ requirement.met?'met':'' }}" href="{{ requirement.group=='technologies'?'#tech-'~requirement.slug:path('app_colony',{id:planet.id,section:'buildings'})~'#item-'~requirement.slug }}">{{ requirement.met?'✓':'○' }} {{ requirement.label }} · {{ requirement.level }}</a>{% endfor %}</div><span class="tech-connector" aria-hidden="true">↓</span><a class="tech-name" href="#item-{{ node.definition.slug }}">{{ node.definition.label }}</a><span class="badge">Niveau {{ node.level }} / {{ node.definition.max_level }}</span><small>{{ node.available?'Prérequis remplis':'Prérequis à atteindre' }}</small></article>{% endfor %}</div>{% endfor %}</div></details>
